Significant changes made in this derivative work:
  - Added a Workspace model: a workspace is a folder in one private git repo
    carrying the skills, scripts and connections for one kind of work.
  - Added workspace membership, sharing, and connection (env) management with
    encrypted-at-rest storage and membership-gated injection.
  - Added sparse cloning so a run fetches only its own workspace's assets.
  - Added workspace file browsing, editing and upload, committing to the repo.
  - Rebranded the product and reworked the interface around workspaces.
